  concept: "Authored objective: R2 Series Branch Current.\nAuthored requirement:
    Installed R2 must carry 7.0-7.5 mA when 220 ohm R2 is in series with 470 ohm
    R3. current \u2265 7 mA. current \u2264 7.5 mA. Connection pair R2_Input and
    R2_Output. Conduction required.\nGeneral teaching principle: Electrical measurements
    are differences or flows that require a correct reference, operating condition
    and fresh solver evidence.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish
    that this objective is complete."
